                                <div><strong style="color: var(--text-head); display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.15rem;">Refer & Earn</strong><span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; display: block;">Referral program for unlocking AI</span></div>
